{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "策划案通过了  (Winning the Charity Show Pitch)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the formal pitch meeting, Bu Xiaogu competes head-to-head against Unit Two, presenting a practical charity-matching format for Xin Huimei's foundation before Chun Yuqiao delivers his verdict. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "放心吧，以前的事我早就忘了，一会儿咱们公平竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "提案会开始了，大家进来吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的这个策划案最大的亮点，就是提前选好几家需要资助的救助中心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后安排他们分别在辛惠美和粉丝面前进行介绍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最后由辛惠美选定一家想要资助的对象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样做既能够体现辛惠美慈善基金的价值观，又可以让大家了解到它的务实性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以上就是我的策划案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "两边都讲完了，你们先出去等消息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "二部的方案有很明显的进步，不过布小谷的策划更有新意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然文娱论在酝酿改版，不如用惠美慈善做个开始吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划过了？真的吗？我现在就去通知粉红哥准备录影！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "放心吧，以前的事我早就忘了，一会儿咱们公平竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured, I forgot about past matters long ago; let us compete fairly shortly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "提案会开始了，大家进来吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The pitch meeting is starting; everyone come inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的这个策划案最大的亮点，就是提前选好几家需要资助的救助中心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The biggest highlight of my proposal is pre-selecting several aid centres in need of funding.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后安排他们分别在辛惠美和粉丝面前进行介绍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then we arrange for them each to present before Xin Huimei and her fans.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最后由辛惠美选定一家想要资助的对象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Finally, Xin Huimei selects one recipient organisation to fund.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样做既能够体现辛惠美慈善基金的价值观，又可以让大家了解到它的务实性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Doing this reflects the values of Xin Huimei's charity fund while showing everyone its practicality.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以上就是我的策划案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That concludes my programme proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "两边都讲完了，你们先出去等消息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both sides have finished presenting; step outside and wait for word first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "二部的方案有很明显的进步，不过布小谷的策划更有新意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit Two's proposal shows clear progress, though Bu Xiaogu's plan is more original.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然文娱论在酝酿改版，不如用惠美慈善做个开始吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since Entertainment Talk is preparing a revamp, let us start with Huimei's charity special.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划过了？真的吗？我现在就去通知粉红哥准备录影！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The proposal passed? Really? I will go notify Brother Fenhong right now to prepare for taping!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "放心吧，以前的事我早就忘了，一会儿咱们公平竞争。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "提案会开始了，大家进来吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的这个策划案最大的亮点，就是提前选好几家需要资助的救助中心。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后安排他们分别在辛惠美和粉丝面前进行介绍。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最后由辛惠美选定一家想要资助的对象。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样做既能够体现辛惠美慈善基金的价值观，又可以让大家了解到它的务实性。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "以上就是我的策划案。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "两边都讲完了，你们先出去等消息吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "二部的方案有很明显的进步，不过布小谷的策划更有新意。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然文娱论在酝酿改版，不如用惠美慈善做个开始吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "策划过了？真的吗？我现在就去通知粉红哥准备录影！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Winning fair and square with fresh ideas, Xiaogu celebrates her first approved show proposal and rushes to prepare for taping. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
